6393090_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KyXm6bSTGpUQ7kNvwGRYUuD&_nc_oc=AdkS4E4QOpw3S4Ovj8dBury2V-zKHaqVrnbk_6mNNUvhROSi1GIR8XSr0Xty0sHFwJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx20r8KvPTbiA6CNTbQTyOCGxBe85xZoGASQkqyWmAazQ&oe=69BAA1F6"}, {"file_name": "magiclab.png", "id": "571678028809339", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982452_571678032142672_4802457235566616749_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PxNs8_I2-tYQ7kNvwHq-NkL&_nc_oc=AdnYFHnay5NeGvEoeKmESIkmmwcnfbkMy9L-QZeMs9qk4IZwd6aHxsC1C6hzG6zC5Ac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxdFxtiShgRYdAdUc7bOURdmEzqxpjXeu5othC32uJ3bA&oe=69BAAB73"}, {"file_name": "Store Images-6.png", "id": "1345003753277335", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307555_1345003756610668_1826594110833715176_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iMt5Ld3wGw0Q7kNvwE0xTZD&_nc_oc=Adkf-tM5FRpVjduA-qpzkvZdepmI77fmv_m-bXNVYzK_jHb2dw7HBHoNldFFSKgo6Zo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxq9pikNcPPSTxZUJyrdCk0K-zKBQ6xiLdJT9OcTAjkGw&oe=69BAB67E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wizard Simulator", "keywords": ["magic", "wand", "duel", "wizard", "rpg"], "long_description": "# Master Magic Spells\nHarness the power of your wand to cast incredible spells with precision. Summon fire, control the elements, and unlock new magical abilities as you explore a mystical world.\n\n# Brew Powerful Potions\nDive into the art of potion-making! Combine rare ingredients, experiment with recipes, and create potions that heal, enhance, or devastate in the heat of battle.\n\n# Duel Other Players\nOutsmart your opponents with quick reflexes and strategic spellcasting in intense multiplayer battles.\n\nAre you ready to become the ultimate wizard?\n\n{1411794410259308}", "short_description": "Cast magic spells, brew powerful potions, and duel other players in epi